## Albert Sans and JetBrains Mono

`priv/static/assets/fonts/` holds unmodified WOFF2 files of Albert Sans and
JetBrains Mono, weights 400 and 500, subsets latin and latin-ext, taken from the
npm packages `@fontsource/albert-sans@5.3.0` and `@fontsource/jetbrains-mono@5.3.0`,
by way of the `ehos_design` package of EmpoweredHouse/ehos-tools.
Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, whose full text,
with each font's copyright line, is beside the files:
`OFL-albert-sans.txt` and `OFL-jetbrains-mono.txt`.

They are served by the dashboard itself, rather than from Google Fonts, because
the dashboard runs under its host's Content-Security-Policy and may have no
internet access.
